    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify head-shape trajectories after transient gap-junction blockade, classify early heads against reference species, and test whether untreated longitudinal remodeling returns them toward the original species centroid.";
